{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vOthY3uIvNXJBE2T4h8nlQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:52.851944+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vOthY3uIvNXJBE2T4h8nlQ","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/U7m2YTmhIl1rSWjwvxdCkY5X0emXQ8Uicib9ARbEpu59obDS32cFH3ibhh3NnkZnhoATc3B4f8mUnFiaXZQ7LpXo2JxmsYAFFEeBVkhfCDESTlU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/U7m2YTmhIl0E6IaR4yqeg0cnic5SgCRqd8dHMm22FmKrxZUrFC0ebDbzpD2NDUS497khoT6KSbBAjJUtzRVnqZAWH04BNqZUibw4fUFQHY0nc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>前言</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>长安大学地球科学与资源学院学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生预报名工作已开启，欢迎全国各校优秀学子踊跃报名。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></p><p><span>2.2027届普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></p><p><span>3. 研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>4. 身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>070900地质学</span></p><p><span>081800地质资源与地质工程</span></p><p><span>085700资源与环境</span></p><p><span>（最终以我校2027年研究生招生目录为准）</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>申请人可于7月27日-9月15日登录长安大学推免生预报名系统（https://yzfw.chd.edu.cn:9091/xly/）填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请，暑期已完成报名的同学请勿重复报名。申请人将以下材料按照顺序整理成一个PDF文件（不超过10M），上传推免生预报名系统。</span></p></section><section><p><span><span>1. 个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 本科成绩单（由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 英语水平证明材料（CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等成绩单）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 学术科研成果（公开发表的学术论文、专利等）和获奖证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6. 申请直博生的学生还须提供两名所报考学科专业领域内教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）的推荐信和专家的职称证书复印件。直博生报名必须有导师接。</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四、联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>申请人请加入长安大学地球科学与资源学院2027年推免（含直博生）预报名群（QQ群号：1065254006），备注“姓名-本科学校-专业—电话”，后续复试具体安排会在QQ群里通知。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五、其他事项</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>其他未尽事宜以长安大学</span><span><span>2027</span></span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2026/0723/c2769a262101/page.htm</span><span>为准。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span>长安大学地球科学与资源学院</span></p><p><span>2026年9月4日</span></p><p><span><span>供稿/资源学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>供图/资源学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审/张凤</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审/许晨</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审/程宏飞</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/U7m2YTmhIl1xMPahd8YF5e3aWeWaQUGQFoBR9IDn7c1CnXNeJaCnZMbcnpQHhsenILq5QhTZgFr3ibBeWeic87DaccMQLd60SNliax8WEOZyA4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"50d625a59ee71fc4544f738bb82c80cc11f9ae68f24188da2fe8228a967f418f","textLength":835,"sourceSha256":"a847bdc89f3d946d244a271f15ffeaa0e385d43b3d3218b8df1ea1d1a45e1640","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4fb6f0b97f5b71b99e34","title":"2026年长安大学地球科学与资源学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:52.851944+00:00"}
